{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Black Cat Bundle! A world of magic, wonder, and throwing all of your money away! This 2D arcade platformer consists of two game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Blitz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab chips, avoid obstacles, and reach a high score to show The Black Cat who's boss! You can either play alone or split the earnings with a buddy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Brawl</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to prove to your friends that you truly are better at gambling than them? Here's your chance! Black Cat Brawl has you going up against 7 of your friends in a team-based slamfest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 rounds with 8 unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable characters, each with their own unique move (can you recognize any?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 palettes per character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in The Black Cat's game show! He's always watching...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793970?t=1768256653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793970?t=1768256653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793970/e0312d895f26b59d8439d1c1bbed832788c6bca5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768256653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793970/e0312d895f26b59d8439d1c1bbed832788c6bca5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768256653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"desc